price for each test run requested by the Contracting Officer and properly completed].  Include costs for labor 
and materials for: processing and treatment, testing and analyzing, report preparation, and other incidental 
work (such as, manufacturers' field services, health and safety monitoring and controls, and utilities).</TXT><BRK/>
<BRK/></SPT>
<SPT><TTL>Feed Oversize Materials Treatment [and][or] Disposal</TTL><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<TXT>Payment for treatment [and][or] disposal of feed oversize soils, washwater process sludge, spent washwater, and 
process treatment soils exceeding post-treatment criteria is provided in [Section <SRF>02 81 00</SRF> TRANSPORTATION AND 
DISPOSAL OF HAZARDOUS MATERIALS][_____].</TXT><BRK/>
<BRK/></SPT>
<SPT><TTL>Other Work Items</TTL><BRK/>
<NTE><BRK/>
<AST/><BRK/>
